Yet another nethack dream.

I remember killing some creatures, one of which
had a wand of death (I had reflection and MR, so
I actually wanted the wand with some charges).
When I get the wand, the Wizard of Yendor shows
up.  So I shoot him with the wand, but it doesn't
kill him!  So I shoot him with another wand of death
which I had (they were all in my pocket), but it still
doesn't kill him.  At this point Rodney is interested
why the death rays are not killing him and we start testing
the wands on him.  Then Rodney tests one of the wands
on a dwarf, and it kills the poor guy! :-)
I ask him whether he has a cloak of magic resistance,
but he says no.  I don't believe him, so I look for a
wand of probing, but instead I find an un-ided wand
which I shoot at him.  It turns out to be magic missile,
and the missile hurts him in the arm.  So I tell him
that this is for sure a bug in nethack.

At this point I woke up convinced that I found a bug.

ps.: this was all happening in my house, and part
of it in my room.  The wands were little pens which
I pressed on one side, and they released the beam
on the other side.  Oh, and Rodney was really funny,
he was fat, and had a blue cloak with purple stripes.
The dream wasn't in ascii of course!



